		{
			dependencies: ["331CD545A1B1E755"]
			description: ["A crafting CPU is a solid box of crafting blocks with at least one &6Crafting Storage&r in it. Storage sets how big a job it can hold; &6Co-Processing Units&r let it run more steps at once. One CPU runs one job, so build a few."]
