			dependencies: ["401395583FA0B7EA"]
			description: ["Name an item and an amount: when the stock drops below it, the &6ME Requester&r orders a craft. Cables, plates and circuits stay topped up without anyone opening a terminal, and the Requester Terminal manages them all from one screen."]
