			dependencies: ["4C1866021512C936"]
			description: ["GregTech's own ME parts: an &6ME Output Bus&r or &6Hatch&r pushes a multiblock's products straight into the network, and an &6ME Input Bus&r or &6Hatch&r pulls in the items and fluids you configure. Each one starts from an EV bus or hatch."]
